#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_color_blocks_2
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Environmental protection is the practice of safeguarding the natural "
"world from harmful human activities and preserving ecosystems for future "
"generations. It involves efforts to reduce pollution, conserve biodiversity, "
"and sustainably manage natural resources such as air, water, and soil.\n"
"        <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ການປົກປັກຮັກສາສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ ແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດເພື່ອປົກປ້ອງທຳມະຊາດຈາກການກະທຳຂອງມະນຸດທີ່ເປັນອັນ"
"ຕະລາຍ ແລະ ຮັກສາລະບົບນິເວດໄວ້ໃຫ້ຄົນຮຸ່ນຫຼັງ. ເຊິ່ງລວມມີຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນມົນລະພິດ, ອະນຸລັກຄວ"
"າມຫຼາກຫຼາຍທາງຊີວະພາບ, ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄອງຊັບພະຍາກອນທຳມະຊາດ ເຊັ່ນ: ອາກາດ, ນ້ຳ, ແລະ ດິນ ຢ່າງຍືນຍົ"
"ງ.\n"
"        <br/>"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_sidegrid
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Every step we take towards sustainability is a commitment to "
"preserving nature's beauty and resources, for today and tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ທຸກບາດກ້າວທີ່ພວກເຮົາກ້າວໄປສູ່ຄວາມຍືນຍົງ ແມ່ນຄຳໝັ້ນສັນຍາໃນການປົກປັກຮັກສາຄວາມສວຍງາມ ແລະ "
"ຊັບພະຍາກອນທຳມະຊາດ, ສຳລັບມື້ນີ້ ແລະ ມື້ອື່ນ."

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        From carbon footprint reduction to renewable energy adoption and "
"biodiversity preservation, our key milestones reflect our commitment to "
"creating a sustainable future for all."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຮອຍຕີນກາກບອນ ຈົນເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ພະລັງງານທົດແທນ ແລະ ການອະນຸລັກຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼ"
"າຍທາງຊີວະພາບ, ຜົນສຳເລັດທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງພວກເຮົາສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງຄວາມມຸ່ງໝັ້ນໃນການສ້າງອະນາຄົດທີ່ຍືນຍົງສຳລັ"
"ບທຸກຄົນ."

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">1.2 Billion</span><br/>\n"
"        Liters of water saved"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">1.2 ຕື້</span><br/>\n"
"        ລິດ ຂອງນ້ຳທີ່ປະຢັດໄດ້"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">2 Million</span><br/>\n"
"        Trees Planted"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">2 ລ້ານ</span><br/>\n"
"        ຕົ້ນໄມ້ທີ່ຖືກປູກ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">45%</span><br/>\n"
"        Reduction in carbon emissions"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">45%</span><br/>\n"
"        ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການປ່ອຍອາຍກາກບອນ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">500,000</span><br/>\n"
"        Tons of materials recycled"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">500,000</span><br/>\n"
"        ໂຕນ ຂອງວັດສະດຸທີ່ນຳມາຣີໄຊເຄິລ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">60%</span><br/>\n"
"        Renewable Energy usage"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">60%</span><br/>\n"
"        ການນຳໃຊ້ພະລັງງານທົດແທນ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">85%</span><br/>\n"
"        Waste diversion rate"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h2-fs\">85%</span><br/>\n"
"        ອັດຕາການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໄປສູ່ບ່ອນຖິ້ມ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_color_blocks_2
msgid "A Call for Environmental Protection"
msgstr "ການຮຽກຮ້ອງເພື່ອປົກປັກຮັກສາສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_treehouse
msgid ""
"Asymmetric side-grid layout opens with numbered impact stats, color-blocked "
"sections, partner references, and a freegrid showcase, with wavy line motifs "
"accenting the side-grid hero. Image-led with stats and partner proof / "
"suited for environmental NGOs, sustainable development non-profits, ecology "
"initiatives, and conscious travel organizations"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຮ່າງ side-grid ແບບບໍ່ສົມມາດ ເປີດໂຕດ້ວຍສະຖິຕິຜົນກະທົບແບບມີຕົວເລກ, ພາກສ່ວນສີ color-"
"blocked, ການອ້າງອີງຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານ, ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນແບບ freegrid, ພ້ອມລວດລາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຄື້ນ ທີ່ເນັ້ນຈຸ"
"ດເດັ່ນຂອງ hero side-grid. ເນັ້ນຮູບພາບພ້ອມສະຖິຕິ ແລະ ຫຼັກຖານຈາກຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານ / ເໝາະສຳລັບ ອົງການຈັ"
"ດຕັ້ງ NGO ດ້ານສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ, ອົງການບໍ່ຫວັງຜົນກຳໄລເພື່ອການພັດທະນາແບບຍືນຍົງ, ຂໍ້ລິເລີ່ມດ້ານນິເວດວິທະຍາ, ແ"
"ລະ ອົງການທ່ອງທ່ຽວແບບມີສະຕິຕໍ່ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_freegrid
msgid "Be Part of the Change"
msgstr "ຮ່ວມເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_treehouse.field_theme_utils__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_treehouse
msgid ""
"Environment, Nature, Ecology, Sustainable Development, Non Profit, NGO, "
"Travels"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ, ທຳມະຊາດ, ນິເວດວິທະຍາ, ການພັດທະນາແບບຍືນຍົງ, ບໍ່ຫວັງຜົນກຳໄລ, NGO, ການທ່ອງທ່ຽວ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_treehouse.field_theme_utils__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_freegrid
msgid ""
"Join us in our mission to protect the environment and promote sustainable "
"development. We focus on creating a greener future through innovative "
"ecological solutions."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກັບພວກເຮົາໃນພາລະກິດເພື່ອປົກປັກຮັກສາສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ສົ່ງເສີມການພັດທະນາແບບຍືນຍົງ. ພວກເຮົາສຸມ"
"ໃສ່ການສ້າງອະນາຄົດທີ່ຂຽວສົດໃສຂຶ້ນ ຜ່ານວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທາງນິເວດວິທະຍາທີ່ສ້າງສັນ."

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_numbers_list
msgid "Key milestones in our environmental impact"
msgstr "ຜົນສຳເລັດທີ່ສຳຄັນໃນຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_references
msgid "More details <i class=\"oi ms-2\" data-icon=\"east\"/>"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ <i class=\"oi ms-2\" data-icon=\"east\"/>"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_sidegrid
msgid "Protect <br/>the planet <br/>for future generations"
msgstr "ປົກປັກຮັກສາ <br/>ໂລກໜ່ວຍນີ້ <br/>ເພື່ອຄົນຮຸ່ນຫຼັງ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_freegrid
msgid "Sustainability for a Better Tomorrow"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍືນຍົງເພື່ອມື້ອື່ນທີ່ດີກວ່າ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_treehouse.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຮູບແບບ"

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_treehouse.s_references
msgid ""
"Together, we collaborate with leading organizations committed to protecting "
"the environment and building a greener future."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຮ່ວມມືກັບບັນດາອົງການຈັດຕັ້ງຊັ້ນນຳ ທີ່ມຸ່ງໝັ້ນໃນການປົກປັກຮັກສາສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ສ້າງອະນາຄົດທີ່ຂຽວສົດໃ"
"ສຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. module: theme_treehouse
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_theme_treehouse
msgid "Treehouse Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Treehouse"
